  m_Text: 'W A S D  /  Arrows   -   walk

    Mouse   -   look around

    E   -   interact (keys, runes, chest, doors)

    Q   -   shift between Present and Past

    Esc   -   pause / back


    Shifting time only works on solid shared stone floor: not while falling, riding the platform or standing on spike plates. If something solid would occupy your space in the other time, the shift is refused.'
